            <ArticleTitle>Treatment of pelvic pain associated with endometriosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S18-27</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain associated with endometriosis requires careful evaluation to exclude other potential causes and may involve a number of different mechanisms. Both medical and surgical treatments for pain related to endometriosis are effective and choice of treatment must be individualized.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
